stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    %% This chart describes a HeartbeatTransaction owned by a follower.
    %% Transition labels identify received messages; notes describe their effects.

    [*] --> STOPPED: transaction constructed
    STOPPED --> WATCHING: start() called

    WATCHING --> WATCHING: valid HeartbeatMsg received

    note right of WATCHING
        Cancel the current watchdog.
        Increment watchdogVersion.
        Schedule a new WatchdogExpiredMsg.
    end note

    %% Messages from an unexpected coordinator and watchdog messages from an
    %% older generation do not change the follower state.
    WATCHING --> WATCHING: invalid HeartbeatMsg received / ignore
    WATCHING --> WATCHING: stale WatchdogExpiredMsg received / ignore

    WATCHING --> ELECTION_REQUESTED: active WatchdogExpiredMsg received

    note right of ELECTION_REQUESTED
        Coordinator considered crashed.
        ElectionTransaction integration is still pending.
        Further watchdog messages are ignored.
    end note

    %% This future transition records the intended handoff once election support
    %% is implemented.
    ELECTION_REQUESTED --> [*]: ElectionTransaction starts

    WATCHING --> [*]: owning Replica crashes
